 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "So today I want to show you the one setting I change on every camera.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.9,
   "breath": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Um, most people never open the settings menu.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.52,
   "breath": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That's where the good stuff is.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 1.5,
   "breath": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is the one I change before I shoot anything.",
   "voice": "b",
   "pause": 1.1
  },
  {
   "text": "Here is the one I change before I shoot anything.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Turn off auto exposure, lock it, and your face",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.7
  },
  {
   "text": "lock it, and your face stops pulsing every time you move.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.8,
   "breath": true
  },
  {
   "text": "It sounds small, uh, but it is the difference between footage that looks cheap and footage that looks shot.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 1.2
  },
  {
   "text": "The second setting is shutter speed.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.9
  },
  {
   "text": "The second setting is shutter speed.",
   "voice": "c",
   "pause": 0.7
  },
  {
   "text": "Set it to double your frame rate, so fifty for twenty five frames.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 2,
   "breath": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And the last one is white balance.",
   "voice": "b",
   "pause": 0.8
  },
  {
   "text": "And the last one is white balance.",
   "voice": "c",
   "pause": 0.9
  },
  {
   "text": "And the last one is white balance.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.5
  },
  {
   "text": "Lock it to daylight and leave it there.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Do it today, and tell me what changed.",
   "voice": "a",
   "pause": 0.8
  }
 ],
